---
name: convo-review
description: Review a finished Claude Code session with ccmeter (summary plus prompt feedback). Not available yet: arrives in ccmeter milestone 3.
disable-model-invocation: true
---

This is a placeholder for ccmeter milestone 3 (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md in the ccmeter repository).

When implemented it will be a thin wrapper: it runs `ccmeter review <session-id>` out of process and shows the
resulting summary. The session digest is never loaded into this conversation.

Until then, tell the user that session review is not implemented yet and that `ccmeter report --session <id>`
shows usage and cost for any recorded session.
